                                "text": "[…] The board of health had prohibited the sale of ice cut from the \"slank,\" because water in the \"slank\" was said to be polluted. The ice dealers, however, contend that the city of Patterson has no right to pollute the river and thus hurt their business, […] stopping the sale of \"slank\" ice, […]"
