                                "sense_id": "0eec239b-d20d-34c3-a8a2-a8588e2ce945",
                                "text": "Van Zaun says that the fishing stopped 15 or 16 years before he testified - that would be about 1890. Mr. Shriner, one of the city's witnesses, says that he caught fish in one of the slanks in 1883 or 1885."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3732d85f-91e8-44a2-83f3-2df7a1359bc3",
                                "sense_id": "0eec239b-d20d-34c3-a8a2-a8588e2ce945",
                                "text": "Passaic, N. J. - The storm will cause great delay in filling in the slank. The dirt which the workmen have been throwing in was washed away into the river."
                            }
                        ]
